{"retcode":0,"message":"OK","data":{"page":{"id":"510177","name":"久岐忍【彩蛋】","desc":"久岐忍彩蛋","icon_url":"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2026/03/21/50494840/92e6c182963578f54245158c20f5c735_6960866399373423450.png","header_img_url":"","modules":[{"name":"基本信息","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"npc_base_info","layout":"","data":"{\"attr\":[{\"value\":[\"\u003cp\u003e久岐忍\u003c/p\u003e\"],\"key\":\"角色名\"},{\"value\":[\"\u003cp\u003e7月27日\u003c/p\u003e\"],\"key\":\"生日\"},{\"value\":[\"\u003cp\u003e荒泷派\u003c/p\u003e\"],\"key\":\"所属\"}],\"extra_attr\":[{\"value\":[\"\u003cp\u003e干练可靠的「荒泷派」的副手——特别注明：干练可靠形容的不是「荒泷派」而是副手。\u003c/p\u003e\"],\"key\":\"角色介绍\"}],\"image\":\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2026/03/05/50494840/33c41932d1b5531ac73bca243c761816_7407132774959199062.png\"}\n","style":""}],"id":"8151","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":false,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"角色展示","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"map_desc","layout":"","data":"{\"list\":[{\"tab_name\":\"角色展示\",\"image\":\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2026/03/05/50494840/7f3da72fa0ce7ad17120e7d90034e746_4251749092047361220.png\"}]}\n","style":""}],"id":"8155","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":false,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"rich_base_info","layout":"","data":"{\"list\":[{\"key\":\"\",\"value\":[\"\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\"]}]}\n","style":""}],"id":"8174","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":false,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"map_desc","layout":"","data":"{\"list\":[{\"tab_name\":\"默认标题\",\"image\":\"\"}]}\n","style":""}],"id":"8175","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":false,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"interactive_dialogue","layout":"","data":"{\"list\":[{\"root_id\":\"hb6x495gza4T1772685748731\",\"child_ids\":{\"hb6x495gza4T1772685748731\":[]},\"contents\":{\"3yrqf5qi257T1772686059189\":{\"option\":\"旅行者：不愧是阿忍！\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"4u5xqqm0tx7T1772686577952\":{\"option\":\"旅行者：等一下！放牛的都进去了…\",\"dialogue\":\"\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"5pv95mv9ev3T1772686014198\":{\"option\":\"旅行者：阿忍好啊，我最近还不错。\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"hb6x495gza4T1772685748731\":{\"option\":\"\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"hi732zk0dikT1772686139196\":{\"option\":\"旅行者：水下？\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cp\u003e久岐忍：嗯。水下的梅洛彼得堡。\u003c/p\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"kdl3qird8wT1772686171031\":{\"option\":\"旅行者：发生什么事了？！\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cp\u003e久岐忍：……\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e荒泷一斗：呜哇…哟吼！这水好凉快呀！\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e荒泷一斗：这船看着不大，跑得倒挺快，但以本大爷的高超泳技，难不成还能输给一艘船？\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e荒泷一斗：阿晃阿守，你们也赶紧下来！比比看谁最快追上船，我赢定…咳咕噜…喂！会不会游泳啊元太！把水扇我嘴里了！\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e元太：老大…等等我…我还没学会…咕噜咕噜…\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e欧菲妮：咿？！请、请乘客不要在水道游泳，这样很危险！\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e欧菲妮：再说一遍：外国游客也需要遵守本地律法，请乘客不要在水道游泳！这样是违反「水道船交通安全法」的——\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e欧菲妮：请问谁是那位大个子先生的朋友吗？可以帮忙劝他上船吗？不然的话…\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e久岐忍：抱歉美露莘小姐，给你添麻烦了，我马上捞他们上来。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e欧菲妮：梅莘。正好你在…\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e梅莘：明白了。这位大个子先生！你的行为严重危害公共交通安全，跟我走一趟吧！\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e荒泷一斗：有证据吗？谁被危害了？不都好好的吗？哼。别怪本大爷没提醒你，我手底下有个顶级律师。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e荒泷一斗：再说了，在稻妻连那个人人都怕的天狗都拿我没办法，就你这个小个子能抓得住我吗？\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e梅莘：呜…小个子…\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e梅莘：太坏了！那维莱特大人说过我有能力做好想做的工作！现在就要逮捕你！\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e久岐忍：闭嘴老大！美露莘警官，我可以配合提供目击证词。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e荒泷一斗：喂阿忍！我们才是一家的吧！你胳膊肘怎么能往外…\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e久岐忍：…本来事情不大，但要是现在不配合，只会越闹越大。你应该也不想在外国丢脸吧。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e荒泷一斗：外拐…往外拐还挺厉害的…哈哈。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e久岐忍：好了，美露莘警官。现在可以放心带他们走了，他们不会反抗的。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e阿晃\u0026阿守\u0026元太：老大——你去哪我们就去哪！\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e久岐忍：…事情经过大概就是这样。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e久岐忍：情节不算严重，等我办完正事后他们的拘留期也正好结束，到时我再顺手把他们领回稻妻。\u003c/p\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"m2fwjyrxajT1772686061248\":{\"option\":\"\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cp\u003e久岐忍：说起这个，这位老板出手很大方，她了解了荒泷派的状况后主动提出要包下其他成员的差旅费用…\u003c/p\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"mey5i15ippsT1772686115392\":{\"option\":\"旅行者：这么说…一斗他们也来了？！\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cp\u003e久岐忍：没错，我们是一起来的。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e久岐忍：算算时间…他们应该已经到水下了。\u003c/p\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"qp75yr1rcbaT1772686299425\":{\"option\":\"旅行者：真是辛苦你了…\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cp\u003e久岐忍：这种程度的麻烦不算什么，我已经习惯了。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e久岐忍：听说梅洛彼得堡跟奉行所牢房的管理风格很不一样，对老大来说，算是个开拓眼界的好机会。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e久岐忍：接下来有空吗，我打算去给师姐和九条小姐她们挑点礼物，可以的话想请你帮忙掌掌眼。\u003c/p\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"qzawdny3xamT1772686495303\":{\"option\":\"旅行者：当然没问题！\",\"dialogue\":\"\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"smz1n4slv9T1772686525375\":{\"option\":\"旅行者：随时可以出发。\",\"dialogue\":\"\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"sp64ne2djgT1772686031310\":{\"option\":\"旅行者：你来枫丹工作吗？\",\"dialogue\":\"\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"uvlh0p44onfT1772686526454\":{\"option\":\"\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cp\u003e久岐忍：那就辛苦你了。稍等，阿丑——\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e久岐忍：我们该走了，快过来。\u003c/p\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"vexcj91s77rT1772686608129\":{\"option\":\"\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cp\u003e阿丑：哞！\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e久岐忍：阿丑一向很有自己的原则，从不参与老大他们任何不合理不合规的活动。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e阿丑：哞哞！\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e久岐忍：除此之外，它平时会帮忙处理很多派里面的大小杂务，比如这趟出差的行李基本都是阿丑负责打包的。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e久岐忍：我曾劝过它，不必勉强留在老大身边，以它的才华，会有更大的作为。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e久岐忍：不过它似乎有自己的打算，既然如此，我会选择相信它。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e阿丑：哞…\u003c/p\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"wllq6dp2k1dT1772686039239\":{\"option\":\"\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cp\u003e久岐忍：嗯。有位老板想将稻妻特产推销到枫丹来，委托了我当咨询顾问和写商业计划书。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e久岐忍：所以来这边出差，协助老板办些当地的手续，正好还能调研市场环境。\u003c/p\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"z47ow99sgprT1772686579625\":{\"option\":\"旅行者：牛怎么还在？！\",\"dialogue\":\"\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"z7icy69tvpT1772686059914\":{\"option\":\"旅行者：荒泷派的业务越做越大了！\",\"dialogue\":\"\",\"icon\":\"\"}}}],\"root_id\":\"\",\"child_ids\":null,\"contents\":null}\n","style":""}],"id":"8176","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":true,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"剧情彩蛋","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"rich_base_info","layout":"","data":"{\"list\":[{\"key\":\"名称\",\"value\":[\"\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\"]},{\"key\":\"上线时间\",\"value\":[\"\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\"]},{\"key\":\"相关奖励\",\"value\":[\"\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\"]}]}\n","style":""}],"id":"8177","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":false,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"地图展示","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"map_desc","layout":"","data":"{\"list\":[{\"tab_name\":\"地图展示\",\"image\":\"\"}]}\n","style":""}],"id":"8178","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":false,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"剧情彩蛋对话","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"interactive_dialogue","layout":"","data":"{\"root_id\":\"\",\"child_ids\":null,\"contents\":null,\"list\":[{\"child_ids\":{\"59exep4og84T1772685748743\":[]},\"contents\":{},\"root_id\":\"59exep4og84T1772685748743\"}]}\n","style":""}],"id":"8179","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":true,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"七圣召唤对话","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"interactive_dialogue","layout":"","data":"{\"list\":[{\"root_id\":\"qf8sjvbt35nT1772685748758\",\"child_ids\":{\"qf8sjvbt35nT1772685748758\":[]},\"contents\":{}}],\"root_id\":\"\",\"child_ids\":null,\"contents\":null}\n","style":""}],"id":"8180","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":true,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"幻想真境剧诗对话","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"interactive_dialogue","layout":"","data":"{\"root_id\":\"\",\"child_ids\":null,\"contents\":null,\"list\":[{\"root_id\":\"iiagg42cpteT1772685748761\",\"child_ids\":{\"iiagg42cpteT1772685748761\":[]},\"contents\":{}}]}\n","style":""}],"id":"8181","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":true,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"生日","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"timeline_base_info","layout":"","data":"{\"list\":[{\"attr\":[{\"key\":\"\",\"value\":[\"\u003cp\u003e多亏荒泷派的那些笨蛋，今年，我又度过了一个「出乎意料」的生日，直到刚刚才把所有善后工作处理完毕。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e都那么久了，还真是不长记性啊\u003cstrong\u003e…\u003c/strong\u003e算了，这也是他们让人放心不下的地方。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e说起来，你现在有时间吗？要不要一起出去走走，就我们两个。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e平日里你对我关照有加，我都记在心里。感谢的话，还是得当面说才够诚恳。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e我闲着没事的时候，又琢磨出了点鸣草的特殊用法，也想向你展示看看…\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e【邮件赠礼：\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-entry-wrapper\\\" data-entry-id=\\\"2331\\\" data-entry-ratio=\\\"text\\\" data-entry-img=\\\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2021/07/21/15568211/4d4b304e272a2c99313932bd3b94c72d_6735008064485391911.png\\\" data-entry-name=\\\"鸣草\\\" data-entry-amount=\\\"10\\\" data-entry-link=\\\"/ys/obc/content/2331/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" data-entry-status=\\\"Online\\\" data-updated=\\\"0\\\"\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"/ys/obc/content/2331/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" class=\\\"entry-material-box entry-material-text\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"entry-material-wrap\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"name\\\"\u003e鸣草\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"amount\\\"\u003e*10\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-entry-wrapper\\\" data-entry-id=\\\"2772\\\" data-entry-ratio=\\\"text\\\" data-entry-img=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2023/11/04/24077343/0b47e48a5b6dfe0d0e1da8f5e2f95d4d_1009743964042651827.png\\\" data-entry-name=\\\"蛋包饭圆舞曲\\\" data-entry-amount=\\\"1\\\" data-entry-link=\\\"/ys/obc/content/2772/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" data-entry-status=\\\"Online\\\" data-updated=\\\"1\\\"\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"/ys/obc/content/2772/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" class=\\\"entry-material-box entry-material-text\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"entry-material-wrap\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"name\\\"\u003e蛋包饭圆舞曲\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"amount\\\"\u003e*1\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e】\u003c/p\u003e\u003cdetails class=\\\"custom-details\\\"\u003e\u003csummary\u003e生日贺图\u003c/summary\u003e\u003cdiv data-type=\\\"detailsContent\\\"\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-image-view\\\" data-image-url=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2026/04/17/50494840/c494d9cfe5eadf72a800672d6864620e_2813549662370124038.png\\\" data-image-unit=\\\"px\\\" data-image-width=\\\"450\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-image-wrapper\\\" style=\\\"width: 450px;\\\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"\\\"\u003e\u003cimg class=\\\"custom-image\\\" src=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2026/04/17/50494840/c494d9cfe5eadf72a800672d6864620e_2813549662370124038.png\\\" style=\\\"width: 450px;\\\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"https://www.miyoushe.com/ys/article/26330848\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\"\u003e久岐忍生日快乐｜谢谢你的关照，那么接下来…\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/details\u003e\"]}],\"tab_name\":\"有时间吗？——2022-07-27\"},{\"attr\":[{\"key\":\"\",\"value\":[\"\u003cp\u003e现在有个棘手情况，今天是我的生日，哦我不是说生日棘手。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e我原本以为这个生日会过得更简单点\u003cstrong\u003e…\u003c/strong\u003e但元太和阿晃出了个主意，建议全体荒泷派成员来个海祇岛一日游，作为我的生日庆祝活动，老大听了更是大声叫好…\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e但我知道，荒泷派一没有野营装备，二不熟海祇岛，就这么跑过去，还不知道会把自己折腾成什么样子\u003cstrong\u003e…\u003c/strong\u003e所以，我想拜托值得信赖的你和我们同行。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e那些家伙们闹腾是闹腾了一点，但逗人开心的本事绝对一流。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e和我们一起去吧，有你在的话，这个一日游应该会很难忘。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e【邮件赠礼：\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-entry-wrapper\\\" data-entry-id=\\\"2772\\\" data-entry-ratio=\\\"text\\\" data-entry-img=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2023/11/04/24077343/0b47e48a5b6dfe0d0e1da8f5e2f95d4d_1009743964042651827.png\\\" data-entry-name=\\\"蛋包饭圆舞曲\\\" data-entry-amount=\\\"1\\\" data-entry-link=\\\"/ys/obc/content/2772/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" data-entry-status=\\\"Online\\\" data-updated=\\\"1\\\"\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"/ys/obc/content/2772/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" class=\\\"entry-material-box entry-material-text\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"entry-material-wrap\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"name\\\"\u003e蛋包饭圆舞曲\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"amount\\\"\u003e*1\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-entry-wrapper\\\" data-entry-id=\\\"2276\\\" data-entry-ratio=\\\"text\\\" data-entry-img=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2023/10/02/24077343/47d81dd3e5af2edd0d391b1b1e7bc8da_3696806033980749181.png\\\" data-entry-name=\\\"饭团\\\" data-entry-amount=\\\"3\\\" data-entry-link=\\\"/ys/obc/content/2276/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" data-entry-status=\\\"Online\\\" data-updated=\\\"0\\\"\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"/ys/obc/content/2276/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" class=\\\"entry-material-box entry-material-text\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"entry-material-wrap\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"name\\\"\u003e饭团\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"amount\\\"\u003e*3\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-entry-wrapper\\\" data-entry-id=\\\"3865\\\" data-entry-ratio=\\\"text\\\" data-entry-img=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2023/10/07/24077343/97406e6764b77efc06a5c2edc5762bd2_5889552761842414375.png\\\" data-entry-name=\\\"炸肉排三明治\\\" data-entry-amount=\\\"3\\\" data-entry-link=\\\"/ys/obc/content/3865/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" data-entry-status=\\\"Online\\\" data-updated=\\\"0\\\"\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"/ys/obc/content/3865/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" class=\\\"entry-material-box entry-material-text\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"entry-material-wrap\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"name\\\"\u003e炸肉排三明治\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"amount\\\"\u003e*3\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e】\u003c/p\u003e\u003cdetails class=\\\"custom-details\\\"\u003e\u003csummary\u003e生日贺图\u003c/summary\u003e\u003cdiv data-type=\\\"detailsContent\\\"\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-image-view\\\" data-image-url=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2026/04/17/50494840/fa4dcbac78b86f734158d9c2fcb237df_4301336225123140490.png\\\" data-image-unit=\\\"px\\\" data-image-width=\\\"450\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-image-wrapper\\\" style=\\\"width: 450px;\\\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"\\\"\u003e\u003cimg class=\\\"custom-image\\\" src=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2026/04/17/50494840/fa4dcbac78b86f734158d9c2fcb237df_4301336225123140490.png\\\" style=\\\"width: 450px;\\\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"https://www.miyoushe.com/ys/article/41737031\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\"\u003e久岐忍生日快乐｜在他们又惹新麻烦之前，陪我一起逛逛？\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/details\u003e\"]}],\"tab_name\":\"速来。——2023-07-27\"},{\"attr\":[{\"key\":\"\",\"value\":[\"\u003cp\u003e唉。老大他们明显狂热过头了，最近总热衷于把所有事情的排场闹大，几天前我就发现他们在偷偷摸摸搭生日会的舞台了\u003cstrong\u003e…\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e不过万幸的是，为了给我惊喜，他们全程瞒着我。按照近几次荒泷派举办活动的经验，缺少我、或者你的助力，最终计划失败也是可预料的结果\u003cstrong\u003e…\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e总之结论是，今年生日我难得不用为了收拾残局而头疼，可以真正地放松放松。不如\u003cstrong\u003e…\u003c/strong\u003e去野外找块地方，吹吹风看看风景，过一个清净惬意的生日。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e我先行出发踩点，排查好魔物的隐患。不嫌麻烦的话，期待你的到来。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e【邮件赠礼：\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-entry-wrapper\\\" data-entry-id=\\\"2772\\\" data-entry-ratio=\\\"text\\\" data-entry-img=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2023/11/04/24077343/0b47e48a5b6dfe0d0e1da8f5e2f95d4d_1009743964042651827.png\\\" data-entry-name=\\\"蛋包饭圆舞曲\\\" data-entry-amount=\\\"1\\\" data-entry-link=\\\"/ys/obc/content/2772/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" data-entry-status=\\\"Online\\\" data-updated=\\\"1\\\"\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"/ys/obc/content/2772/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" class=\\\"entry-material-box entry-material-text\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"entry-material-wrap\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"name\\\"\u003e蛋包饭圆舞曲\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"amount\\\"\u003e*1\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-entry-wrapper\\\" data-entry-id=\\\"2610\\\" data-entry-ratio=\\\"text\\\" data-entry-img=\\\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2021/08/31/4820086/9cad2999f1b417dba8e84bba95f29263_7335635232854236656.png\\\" data-entry-name=\\\"浮游幽核\\\" data-entry-amount=\\\"5\\\" data-entry-link=\\\"/ys/obc/content/2610/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" data-entry-status=\\\"Online\\\" data-updated=\\\"0\\\"\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"/ys/obc/content/2610/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" class=\\\"entry-material-box entry-material-text\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"entry-material-wrap\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"name\\\"\u003e浮游幽核\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"amount\\\"\u003e*5\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e】\u003c/p\u003e\u003cdetails class=\\\"custom-details\\\"\u003e\u003csummary\u003e生日贺图\u003c/summary\u003e\u003cdiv data-type=\\\"detailsContent\\\"\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-image-view\\\" data-image-url=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2026/04/17/50494840/135d69407f37ec4ed3f6fb326296d4fb_8199395079278574297.png\\\" data-image-unit=\\\"px\\\" data-image-width=\\\"450\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-image-wrapper\\\" style=\\\"width: 450px;\\\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"\\\"\u003e\u003cimg class=\\\"custom-image\\\" src=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2026/04/17/50494840/135d69407f37ec4ed3f6fb326296d4fb_8199395079278574297.png\\\" style=\\\"width: 450px;\\\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"https://www.miyoushe.com/ys/article/55790572\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\"\u003e久岐忍生日快乐｜手感意外得不错呢，毛茸茸的。\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/details\u003e\"]}],\"tab_name\":\"难得清净…——2024-07-27\"},{\"attr\":[{\"key\":\"\",\"value\":[\"\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color: rgb(44, 62, 80)\\\"\u003e今天，家里托人捎来了一些用鸣草制作的香囊和挂饰，东西本身不算特别，但捏在手里的感觉…很不一样。这是我离家出走后第一次收到他们这样纯粹的问候，没有打压也没有像往常那样劝我回家，只祝愿我顺利安康。曾经的分歧和束缚，此刻变成了小心翼翼的关心\u003c/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e…\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color: rgb(44, 62, 80)\\\"\u003e即便有了家人的支持，要做的委托也不会变少，要考的证书难度也不会降低，但内心多了些「坚持下去」的力量，也算一种积极的心理暗示吧。我取了其中几支带有家人祝福的鸣草，做成轻便的手环。也愿它能在你前路迷茫时，给你传递支持和力量。\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e【邮件赠礼：\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-entry-wrapper\\\" data-entry-id=\\\"2331\\\" data-entry-ratio=\\\"text\\\" data-entry-img=\\\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2021/07/21/15568211/4d4b304e272a2c99313932bd3b94c72d_6735008064485391911.png\\\" data-entry-name=\\\"鸣草\\\" data-entry-amount=\\\"10\\\" data-entry-link=\\\"/ys/obc/content/2331/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" data-entry-status=\\\"Online\\\" data-updated=\\\"0\\\"\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"/ys/obc/content/2331/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" class=\\\"entry-material-box entry-material-text\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"entry-material-wrap\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"name\\\"\u003e鸣草\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"amount\\\"\u003e*10\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-entry-wrapper\\\" data-entry-id=\\\"2772\\\" data-entry-ratio=\\\"text\\\" data-entry-img=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2023/11/04/24077343/0b47e48a5b6dfe0d0e1da8f5e2f95d4d_1009743964042651827.png\\\" data-entry-name=\\\"蛋包饭圆舞曲\\\" data-entry-amount=\\\"1\\\" data-entry-link=\\\"/ys/obc/content/2772/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" data-entry-status=\\\"Online\\\" data-updated=\\\"1\\\"\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"/ys/obc/content/2772/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" class=\\\"entry-material-box entry-material-text\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"entry-material-wrap\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"name\\\"\u003e蛋包饭圆舞曲\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"amount\\\"\u003e*1\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e  】\u003c/p\u003e\u003cdetails class=\\\"custom-details\\\"\u003e\u003csummary\u003e生日贺图\u003c/summary\u003e\u003cdiv data-type=\\\"detailsContent\\\"\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-image-view\\\" data-image-url=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2026/04/17/50494840/c8eefca394d5756f9cab20ba40f82f8c_6975469188742650814.png\\\" data-image-unit=\\\"px\\\" data-image-width=\\\"450\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-image-wrapper\\\" style=\\\"width: 450px;\\\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"\\\"\u003e\u003cimg class=\\\"custom-image\\\" src=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2026/04/17/50494840/c8eefca394d5756f9cab20ba40f82f8c_6975469188742650814.png\\\" style=\\\"width: 450px;\\\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"https://www.miyoushe.com/ys/article/66832547\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\"\u003e久岐忍生日快乐｜这鬼鬼祟祟从背后接近我的架势…\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/details\u003e\"]}],\"tab_name\":\"共勉…——2025-07-27\"},{\"attr\":[{\"key\":\"\",\"value\":[\"\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color: rgb(44, 62, 80)\\\"\u003e往年老大他们为了筹备「惊喜」，总是背着我折腾。但这次却反常地请我先过目庆祝事宜和申请派内资金援助，理由是想邀请你一起过来热闹。\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color: rgb(44, 62, 80)\\\"\u003e我一一检查了计划表和采购单，各项安排意外地合理且得体…难道是有阿丑把关？\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color: rgb(44, 62, 80)\\\"\u003e唯一的隐患是最后一项「惊喜环节」依旧被保留了，说什么都不让我看，虽然我也实在不愿细想他们又要闹哪一出…但我相信，至少在招待你这件事上，荒泷派的每一位都会付出能力范围内的全部诚意。\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color: rgb(44, 62, 80)\\\"\u003e所以，我也决定配合他们，写下这份不算正式的邀请，见笑了。如果你难得清闲，就来坐坐吧。\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color: rgb(44, 62, 80)\\\"\u003e请放宽心，无论出现什么状况，都有我兜底。\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e【邮件赠礼：\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-entry-wrapper\\\" data-entry-id=\\\"2772\\\" data-entry-ratio=\\\"text\\\" data-entry-img=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2023/11/04/24077343/0b47e48a5b6dfe0d0e1da8f5e2f95d4d_1009743964042651827.png\\\" data-entry-name=\\\"蛋包饭圆舞曲\\\" data-entry-amount=\\\"1\\\" data-entry-link=\\\"/ys/obc/content/2772/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" data-entry-status=\\\"Online\\\" data-updated=\\\"1\\\"\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"/ys/obc/content/2772/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" class=\\\"entry-material-box entry-material-text\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"entry-material-wrap\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"name\\\"\u003e蛋包饭圆舞曲\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"amount\\\"\u003e*1\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-entry-wrapper\\\" data-entry-id=\\\"2315\\\" data-entry-ratio=\\\"text\\\" data-entry-img=\\\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2021/07/21/15568211/ee30fcde40aca00c17dc95b9d369566d_3602908419727555323.png\\\" data-entry-name=\\\"「风雅」的指引\\\" data-entry-amount=\\\"1\\\" data-entry-link=\\\"/ys/obc/content/2315/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" data-entry-status=\\\"Online\\\" data-updated=\\\"0\\\"\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"/ys/obc/content/2315/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" class=\\\"entry-material-box entry-material-text\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"entry-material-wrap\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"name\\\"\u003e「风雅」的指引\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"amount\\\"\u003e*1\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e】\u003c/p\u003e\u003cdetails class=\\\"custom-details\\\"\u003e\u003csummary\u003e生日贺图\u003c/summary\u003e\u003cdiv data-type=\\\"detailsContent\\\"\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-image-view\\\" data-image-url=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2026/07/27/50494840/4e020053772deb3e976970f7c89a93f5_6776910944147752047.png\\\" data-image-unit=\\\"px\\\" data-image-width=\\\"450\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-image-wrapper\\\" style=\\\"widt